# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:46
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "आमुख"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:48
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kwrite; is more than a text editor by &kde;. It is meant to be a "
"programmer's editor, and could be considered as at least a partial "
"alternative to more powerful editors. It may be best used in conjunction "
"with &konqueror; or &dolphin; for source file browsing for different "
"languages. &kwrite; also works very well as a simple text editor. One of "
"&kwrite;'s main features is the colorized syntax, customized for many "
"different programming languages such as: C/C++, &Java;, Python, Perl, Bash, "
"Modula 2, &HTML;, and Ada. &kwrite; has a single document interface "
"(<acronym>SDI</acronym>) allowing you to edit one file at the time per "
"window."
msgstr ""
"&kwrite; &kde; द्वारा पाठसम्पादकात् अधिकम् अस्ति। इदं प्रोग्रामरस्य "
"सम्पादकं भवितुम् अभिप्रेतम्, अधिकशक्तिशालिनः सम्पादकानां न्यूनातिन्यूनं "
"आंशिकविकल्पः इति गणयितुं शक्यते स्म । &konqueror; अथवा &dolphin; "
"विभिन्नभाषाणां कृते स्रोतसञ्चिकाब्राउजिंग् कृते । &kwrite; "
"सरलपाठसम्पादकरूपेण अपि अतीव सुन्दरं कार्यं करोति । &kwrite;इत्यस्य "
"मुख्यविशेषतासु एकं वर्णयुक्तं वाक्यविन्यासः अस्ति, यत् "
"अनेकविभिन्नप्रोग्रामिंगभाषाणां कृते अनुकूलितं भवति यथा: C/C++, &Java;, "
"Python, Perl, Bash, Modula 2, &HTML;, Ada च &kwrite; एकं दस्तावेज-अन्तरफलकं "
"(<acronym>SDI</acronym>) अस्ति यत् प्रति-विण्डो-समये एकां सञ्चिकां "
"सम्पादयितुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:60
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kwrite; is a simple interface to the &katepart; component also used by "
"&kate;, &kdevelop;, and other applications from &kde; that require advanced "
"text editing. Therefore, complete documentation for all the features of "
"&kwrite; can be found in the <ulink url=\"help:/katepart\">&katepart; "
"Handbook</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&kwrite; &katepart; घटकः &kate;, &kdevelop;, इत्यादिभिः अनुप्रयोगैः अपि "
"उपयुज्यते &kde; येषु उन्नतपाठसम्पादनस्य आवश्यकता भवति। अतः &kwrite; <ulink "
"url=\"help:/katepart\">&katepart; हस्तपुस्तिका</ulink>।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:69
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Line Options"
msgstr "आदेशपङ्क्तिविकल्पाः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:71
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Though &kwrite; may most often be started from the &plasma; application "
"starter, or a desktop icon, it can also be opened at the command line "
"prompt of a terminal window. There are a few useful options that are "
"available when doing this."
msgstr ""
"यद्यपि &kwrite; प्रायः &plasma; application starter, अथवा desktop icon, इदं "
"terminal window इत्यस्य command line prompt इत्यत्र अपि उद्घाटयितुं शक्यते "
"। एतत् कुर्वन् कतिपये उपयोगिनो विकल्पाः उपलभ्यन्ते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:78
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many other applications that use &katepart; offer similar command line "
"options."
msgstr ""
"अन्ये बहवः अनुप्रयोगाः ये &katepart; समानानि आदेशपङ्क्तिविकल्पानि प्रदातुं "
"शक्नुवन्ति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:82
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify a File"
msgstr "एकं सञ्चिकां निर्दिशन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:84
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By specifying the path and name of a particular file the user can have "
"&kwrite; open (or create) that file immediately upon startup. This option "
"might look something like the following:"
msgstr ""
"सञ्चिकाविशेषस्य मार्गं नाम च निर्दिश्य उपयोक्तुः &kwrite; प्रारम्भे "
"तत्क्षणमेव तां सञ्चिकां उद्घाटयन्तु (अथवा रचयन्तु) । एषः विकल्पः "
"निम्नलिखितवत् किमपि दृश्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:88
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kwrite</command>\n"
"<option><replaceable>/home/myhome/docs/myfile.txt</replaceable></option>\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> "
"क्व्रिते</command><option><replaceable> / गृह / myhome / docs / "
"myfile.txt</replaceable></option></userinput>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:92
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify a file on the Internet"
msgstr "अन्तर्जालस्य सञ्चिकां निर्दिशन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:94
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The above-mentioned method could even be used to open files on the Internet "
"(if the user has an active connection at the time.) An example of this "
"might look like the following:"
msgstr ""
"उपरि उल्लिखिता पद्धतिः अन्तर्जालस्य सञ्चिकाः उद्घाटयितुं अपि उपयोक्तुं "
"शक्यते स्म (यदि तस्मिन् समये उपयोक्तुः सक्रियः संयोजनः अस्ति ।) अस्य "
"उदाहरणं निम्नलिखितम् इव दृश्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:98
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kwrite</command>\n"
"<option><replaceable>ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/README</replaceable>\n"
"</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>% .</prompt><userinput><command> "
"क्व्रिते</command><option><replaceable> ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/README "
"इति ग्रन्थः</replaceable></option></userinput>"

