# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:173
#. Tag: userinput
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kwrite</command> <option>-i</option>, <option>--stdin</option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>क्व्रिते</command><option value=-i> -अहम्‌</option> , ९.<option "
"value=--stdin> --stdin</option>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:175
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Causes &kwrite; to read the document content from STDIN. This is similar to "
"the common option <option>-</option> used in many command line programs, "
"and allows you to pipe command output into &kwrite;."
msgstr ""
"कारणानि &amp;kwrite; STDIN तः दस्तावेजसामग्री पठितुं । एतत् "
"सामान्यविकल्पसदृशम् अस्ति<option value=-> - ९.</option> अनेकेषु "
"आदेशपङ्क्तिकार्यक्रमेषु उपयुज्यते, तथा च &amp;kwrite;मध्ये आदेशनिर्गमं "
"पाइप् कर्तुं शक्नोति ।"

